==Quest Start==

Talk to Holwin in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Holwin'
:''Holwin says, 'Peace to you, Gand.  I see that you have come far along the path of tranquility and enlightenment.  Do you wish to [test] yourself further, and perhaps complete the path you started on so long ago?' ''
You say, 'I wish to test myself further and complete the path of tranquility and enlightenment'
:''Holwin says 'Do you wish to follow the path of Ton Po or Wu?  The path of Ton Po, known for his uncanny abilities, consists of three trials. [Strength], [sight], and [speed]. The path of Wu, known for his introspection, has three further trials.  [Tears], [fists], and [tranquility].  Now, choose.''

== Monk Test of Strength ==
You say, 'Strength'

Holwin says, 'So be it, the test of strength you shall have. Bring to me some silken strands and a wind rune caza.  The task will not be easy, but it should serve as an adequate test of strength, for one of your abilities.' 

'''Reward:''' {{:Back Straps of Mastery}}

